    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "lvk\n\n\nToby Fox, Temmie Chang, UNDERTALE and DELTARUNE teams\n\nShayy\n\n\nBornLosersGaming\n\n\nHUECYCLES\n\nDorked\n\n\nSubna\n\n\n\nnabbup (Raine)\n\n\nKasssm\nEllisBros\nNickolas\n\nGonerBoy\nStarGazer88\n\n\ngoldenanomaly\n\nChara Violet\n\nTeam Undertale Yellow\n\n\n\nemihead"
